            "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:06:54.828118+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where the build scales like crazy, every hit of [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) procs [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4), so you get a lot of ult charge and [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) makes your ult insanely powerful.\n\n[Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) also procs [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), increasing the value each pack gets by a lot.\n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) might be required if they have way too much healing, just sell any purple thats not part of the main combo if you have to buy it.\n\nAlso important to note that from this point foward, [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) becomes better than [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) if you need to buy a green.",
